App Flow (in order):

Splash + 3-slide Welcome Carousel
Sign Up — College Email OTP or Document Upload
Profile Setup — photo, name, college, year, city, 3 story prompts, proof of work
Project Type — Long-Term Peer or Short-Term Buddy (can select both)
Interest Selection — Long-Term: max 2 from 16 interests. Short-Term: 1 activity from 7
Seriousness Test — 25 questions total (Long-Term only) — Knowledge + Behavior + Commitment
Score Result — Beginner/Learning/Intermediate/Expert
Connection Type — 1-on-1, Short Group, Society (Long-Term) or 1-on-1, Short Group (Short-Term)
Auto Match — opens chat directly on match, queue message if no match
Chat — text only, real-time, read receipts

Matching Logic:

Match by: same college + same interest + similar level (±1 level tolerance) + same connection type
Short Group: open chat at 2 members, add more up to 4 automatically
Society: auto-join instantly
Queue: check every 30 seconds for new matches

